{
  "id": 8,
  "title": "Describing things",
  "goal": "Describe people and things by colour, size and quality, and compare them (bigger, the biggest).",
  "intro": "Good news: Telugu adjectives **never change** for gender or number. *పెద్ద* (pedda, big) stays the same in *పెద్ద ఇల్లు* (big house) and *పెద్ద ఇళ్ళు* (big houses).\n\nTo say something *is* big, you either add *-గా ఉంది* ('is in a big way': *పెద్దగా ఉంది*) or turn the adjective into a noun with *-ది* ('a big one': *పెద్దది*). Comparison uses *కంటే* (kaṇṭē, than).",
